  "verseCount": 25,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "23",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "DEU 23"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "23",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Abo batigelilwe kūbiza mu kwibilinga",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 23:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū ngosha ūyo asoloolilwe nūūlū atīnīkile kū wīma mbele atigeleelilwe kwisangīja ū mu kwibilinga kwa banhū ba ng'wa SEEBA. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.23.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.23.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 23:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nū munhū wa nda ya bū hamò būbyīle bokwe kūshisha kū shibyalīlwe sh'ikūmi, atigeleelilwe kwisangīja ū mu kwibilinga kwa banhū ba ng'wa SEEBA. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.23.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.23.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 23:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A Baamoni na a Bamoabu pye a bose nī shibyalīlwe shabo batazunīlījiwe ū kwingīla ū mu kwibilinga kwa banhū ba ng'wa SEEBA, kūshisha kū shibyalīlwe sh'ikūmi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.23.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.23.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 23:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nguno aho ng'walī mu lūgendo kūfuma kū sī ya Misili batamusūng'wanhile na kūng'winha minzī; ha ng'wanya gwaho bakang'honga hela Balaamu ng'witūnja o ng'wa Beoli muna Petooli ya Alamu-nahalaimu, gīkī amuzume. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.23.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.23.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 23:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gwike ū SEEBA Mulungu wako ūlema ūkūndegeleka ū Balaamu, ī lizumo lyakwe ūlīgalūcha kūbiza ū kūlī bebe, nguno ū SEEBA Mulungu wako akūtogilwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.23.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.23.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 23:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū mu būpanga wako bose yaya gete ū kūbalombela mhola nūūlū a benabo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.23.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.23.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 23:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alīyo ū muna Edomu, ū ng'wenūyo yaya ū kūndalaha nguno ndūgūyo; nūūlū ū muna Misili yaya ū kūndalaha, nguno ū bebe wikala ū mu sī yakwe nyageni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.23.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.23.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 23:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A baana babo a bakūbyalwa mu shibyalīlwe sha kadatū badūgije ū kwingīla ū mu kwibilinga kwa banhū ba ng'wa SEEBA.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.23.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.23.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Būsoso mu ng'hambī",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 23:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.23.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.23.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 23:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ūlū ūfuma ū mu ng'hambī yako kūja kwilwisha būlūgū na banishi bako, ilang'hanage ūtizikuumya na shikolo shisoso shose shose. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.23.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.23.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 23:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ūlū ūmò wa bagosha ba mu bing'we ūsosohala kūlwa nguno ya kwiloteela būjikū, īkūng'wigeleelwa kūja hanze ya ng'hambī akikale kwenūko. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.23.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.23.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 23:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ūlū lyūheeha ī līīmi, ooga mu minzī ū mīlī gwakwe, hūna ūlū līlīshilīlīkīīla ī līīmi ūshoka ū mu ng'hambī. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.23.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.23.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 23:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ūkūsola ipandī, ī hanze ya ng'hambī, ūko ūkūyūja kwigunanha. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.23.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.23.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 23:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū mu shikolo sha kūtūmamīla, bizaga na kagembe kado na kado ū mu kaya, ka kūyūsīmbīla. Ūlū ūja kwigunanha, sīmbaga kachongo; hama ūlū ūmala ū kwigunanha galūkaga ūbūfukīīle ū būsoso wako. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.23.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.23.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 23:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nguno ū SEEBA Mulungu wako akūyeelaga hamò nang'ho ū mu ng'hambī yako kūlwa kūkūlang'hana, na kūbatūūla mu makono gako a banishi bako. Na lūūlū ī ng'hambī yako shiigelile ībize neela, atizūbona būsoso ū mulī bebe agalūke īnge akūleke.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.23.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.23.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Shilagīlo sha mbika ningī",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 23:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.23.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.23.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 23:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ūlū nsese ūpeela kūfuma kūlī ise būgonzo wiza kwibisa ha ng'wako, yaya ū kūmfunya gīkī ashoke ko hangī. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.23.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.23.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 23:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nekage wigashe hamò ning'we hose hose aho alatogwe wei ng'wenekīlī, mu nzengo ūyo alasole we; nīyo yaya nū kūng'wiboneela. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.23.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.23.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 23:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Atizilonga munhū ose ose ū mu Baisilaeli, ngosha nūūlū nkīma, wa kwītīla mihayo ya būjingi na wīmīlīzu mu numba ya ng'wa SEEBA Mulungu wako. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.23.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.23.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 23:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Sabo jose jose ījo jilonga kūfuma mu būjingī nūūlū wīmīlīzu wa bakīma na bagosha, yaya ū kūjenha mu numba ya ng'wa SEEBA Mulungu wako kwiza kūfunya shakwinha sha kūlahīla kwa mbika yose yose. Nguno ī shose shenīshi shilī sha malofu ū kūlī SEEBA Mulungu wako. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.23.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.23.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 23:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ūlū ūngunanha ndūgūyo mu mhayo gose gose yaya kūnomba solobo; ūbize wangunanhile hela nūūlū shilīwa, nūūlū shikolo shingī shose shose, īsho ūshikile kūpandīka solobo kūfuma musho. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.23.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.23.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 23:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ūlū munhū w'ihanga līngī ūdūgije ūkūnsoja solobo, alīyo ū ndūgūyo, ū Ng'wisilaeli, ū ng'wenūyo yaya gete. Ū mu gīko ū SEEBA Mulungu wako akūkwīlūkīla ningī ū mu yose īyo ūkwīyīta ū mu sī īyo ūlīja kwīdima ībize yako. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.23.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.23.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 23:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ūlū ūlahīla mhayo gose gose kūlī SEEBA Mulungu wako, yaya ū kūdīla ū kūgūshikīlīja. Nguno ū mhayo gwenūyo akūkūbūūja ū SEEBA Mulungu wako ūgayiwe ū gwa kūhaya, ūbize ng'hūbi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.23.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.23.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 23:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alīyo ūlū wikala ūtalahīlile, ūtūūgwa ū mu būhūbi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.23.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.23.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 23:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Būlī mhayo ūyo ūlagūhaye na nomo gwako managa gīkī īkwigeleelilwe kūgūshikīlīja, nguno ī shilahīlo shenīsho wabeejaga bebe ng'wenekīlī na nomo gwako kūlī SEEBA Mulungu wako. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.23.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.23.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 23:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ūlū wingīla mu ngūnda gwa mizabibu gwa ndūgūyo, ūdūgije kūlya ī mizabibu gīt'ūmo ūlatogelwe, alīyo ūtizūtūūla na mu shigabbu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.23.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.23.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 23:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ūlū ūbīta mu ngūnda gwa ndūgūyo, ūdūgije kūhūlūla a mangala ūlya ī mbeke, alīyo ūtizūsola lūshū wandye kūbūgesa ū būsīga ūbo wīmīīlile.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.23.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.23.25"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
